meta-own
========

Layer for a minimal Raspberry Pi 5 image with Dropbear SSH reachable over
the onboard Wi-Fi. See ../README.md for build instructions.

Dependencies
------------

  URI: https://git.yoctoproject.org/poky
  layers: meta (core)
  branch: scarthgap

  URI: https://github.com/agherzan/meta-raspberrypi
  branch: scarthgap
  (provides MACHINE = "raspberrypi5")

Contents
--------

  recipes-core/images/own-image.bb
      The image: Dropbear, wpa_supplicant, iw, wireless-regdb. Injects the
      root password hash and Wi-Fi credentials from the file in RPI5_SECRETS
      at do_rootfs time.

  recipes-core/init-ifupdown/
      /etc/network/interfaces that brings up wlan0 at boot with DHCP and
      Wi-Fi power save off, and eth0 with DHCP when a cable is plugged in.

  recipes-core/base-files/
      Hostname rpi5-hw.

  recipes-core/ssh-authorized-keys/
      Public key allowed to log in as root (/home/root/.ssh/authorized_keys).

The build configuration lives in ../meta-own-ros/conf/templates/default.
